# Team repos cloned into ~/work at first onboarding. One owner/repo per line;
# lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to devbox-repos.default (gitignored) and list your org's
# repos. On first onboard the box copies the list to ~/.devbox-repos, which
# each dev can edit afterwards. Without the file, onboarding just skips
# cloning.
#
# your-org/backend
# your-org/web
